<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line ltx_leqno">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">AgentSentinel: An End-to-End and Real-Time Security Defense Framework for Computer-Use Agents</h1>
<span class="ltx_pubnotes ltx_pubnotes_meta"><span class="ltx_pubnotes_content"><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_ccs"><span class="ltx_note_name">CCS: </span>Security and privacy Software and application security</span></span></span>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
